  "instructions": [
    "In a medium saucepan, bring the water to a boil over high heat.",
    "Add the chicken breast to the boiling water and cook for 5 minutes, or until it reaches an internal temperature of 165°F.",
    "Remove the chicken from the water and place it on a plate.",
    "Brush the honey evenly over the top of the chicken, then sprinkle with salt, black pepper, garlic powder, and paprika."
